From f94890f6587d82981ac871a685ed4e77d2650361 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Jul 2023 15:51:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rss/kronos: Add support of booting 3 SI clusters

This commit adds the support of loading and booting 3 safety island
clusters.
1. Setup flash layout and flash map;
2. Load image in the order of SCP, SI CL0, SI CL1, SI CL2 and LCP;
3. Use MHUv3 to tell SCP to boot safety island clusters;
4. Skip loading of MCP which is not needed in rdkronos platform.
5. Increase size of BOOT_TFM_SHARED_DATA_SIZE to 0x800:w

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Signed-off-by: Hongda Deng <Hongda.Deng@arm.com>
